<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index drops 13.5 points to 875.3.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index drops 13.5 points to 875.3.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, dropped 13.5 points on Monday to 875.3 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>All of the ten sectoral indices fell, with the machinery index falling the most, down 28.5 points to 1,151.6.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
